Introduction:
We can encounter challenges on life that can be very difficult to
overcome, school, friends, relationships or family.

Body:
Sharing with someone might appear to be the right solution but it can
also appear to backfire, because others might not evaluate the difficulty of
the challenge in the same perspective that you might posees.

I believe that I can testify to the trust that God wants to build personally
with everyone in the room, that if you need a friend that could understand
the level or the complexity that you experience in a challenge, he would go a
step further than just comprehend, and to demonstrate this I wish to share an
experience.

Argument: 
God response is always the best response, that doens't stomp, but encourages,
comprehends, animates and fills you to see that there is a solution to every
problem.

